{"retractions" [[17592186344236 :question/problem "The triple integral\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={\\int }_{a}^{b}{\\int }_{∗}^{∗}{\\int }_{∗}^{∗}f(x,y,z)\\,dz\\,dx\\,dy\n$$\n\nis defined over the type I region $R,$ given by\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,\\frac{1}{2}y\\le x\\le 2,\\,1\\le y\\le 4,\\,0\\le z\\le 4-x-y}.\n$$\n\nWhat is $a+b?$"] [17592186344236 :question/worked-solution "A type I region in three-dimensional space can be written as\n\n$$\nR={(x,y,z)\\,:\\,(x,y)\\in D,\\,{u}_{1}(x,y)\\le z\\le {u}_{2}(x,y)}.\n$$\n\nA typical three-dimensional type I region can be visualized schematically, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14062541/assets/1bd4b6d0b1aa955921c1f7855d3fbd95417072a67504d9de9be44dfbbed592e5.png)\n\n \n\nIf $R$ is a type I region, we can express the triple integral of $f(x,y,z)$ over $R$ as a mixed integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{{u}_{1}(x,y)}^{{u}_{2}(x,y)}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}z]\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{u}_{1}(x,y)=0,\\,{u}_{2}(x,y)=4-x-y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our triple integral can be written as\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-y}f(x,y,z)\\,dz]dA.\n$$\n\nNow, the region $D$ is given by\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{1}{2}y\\le x\\le 2,\\,1\\le y\\le 4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by expressing the double integral over $D$ as a repeated integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-y}f(x,y,z)\\,dz]dA & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}{\\int }_{y/2}^{2}[{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-y}f(x,y,z)\\,dz]dx\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{4}{\\int }_{y/2}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{4-x-y}f(x,y,z)\\,dz\\,dx\\,dy.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\na+b=1+4=5.\n$$"] [17592186344236 :question/answer-fields 17592186344237]] "immutable_answers" [17592186344238 17592186344239 17592186344240 17592186344241 17592186344242] "immutable_fields" [[17592186344237 :answer-field/id] [17592186344237 :answer-field/key] [17592186344237 :answer-field/type] [17592186344237 :answer-field/correct] [17592186344237 :answer-field/choices]]}
